Z||000026||Fierochic88||12-20-2001||02:22 PM||||Hey Everyone -<BR>    Sorry it took me so long to reply.  I have been away from my PC for a few days.  Januar 5th is looking good so just contact me to let me know if you are coming and what you would like to bring.  Post here, e-mail me or private message me.<P><BR>Scott - From Ohio (Columbus area) it is about seven hours.  I live in Oley (ZIP 19547) but Reading (ZIP 19601) is the closest major city (about 10 min from my house).  I am about 25 min from the PA Tpk.<P>Mark - bring whatever!  But definitely the 3.4 car!<P>Ski - you better not be skiing!<P>DCaprio - contact me by e-mail or PM for directions...<P>Kempo - check your PM!  Bring yourselves and some food if you want!<P>JT - You better be there!  Sorry I missed wings the other night.  I wish someone had called me to let me know you were going.  I always wanted to go to Rookies.  I will give you a head count as the date looks closer.<P>Jncomutt - e-mail or PM me and I will get you directions.<P>ALL - our place is located in Oley, PA about 10 minutes from Reading/45 minutes from Philly and 45 minutes from Allentown, PA<P><BR>Anyone who needs directions let me know!<P>Jennifer||||reg||1
